codex
The entry proof is spending time at the symbolic odd-index slice because that sequence is opaque until structurally narrowed. I’ve confirmed the loop theorem itself still closes after moving its anchor to the semantics’ `#iterNext` state; I’m now checking the exact claim-selection/trust wiring so the entry proof applies that theorem instead of trying to unfold the opaque iterator.
